### API МП (Bearer) — ядро

- `GET/PATCH /me`, shift, fine, `POST /me/location`, `POST /me/fcm`  
- orders: create, mine, feed, complete, status, accept-bid, dequeue, cancel, hide, geo, GET/PATCH `:id`  
- bids CRUD  
- payments POST/GET/PATCH  
- chats: ensure, list, messages (HTTP + WSS)  
- reviews / verifications / addresses / cards / push / peer public  

### WSS протокол

`{ "t", "id?", "p" }` — `auth` → `auth.ok`; `chat.subscribe|history|send` → `chat.new` / `chat.history.ok`  
Задел: `order.updated` (ещё не wired с сервера заказов).

